WEBVTT

00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:08,840
Hello everybody, this is Dr. Kevin Cutters, and this is episode 11 in my personal journey, and

00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,840
I'm going to share with you

00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:15,840
a poem that God gave me that is

00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:18,840
that is

00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,840
really from my heart to

00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:27,840
my family, my wife, my patients,

00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:30,840
my friends, my staff,

00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:35,840
my acquaintances, and I really pray that God is

00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,840
changing me every day that this poem can be

00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:46,840
my heartfelt wish for what I can be in your life.

00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:50,840
So, it's called that I may be

00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:54,840
and I want to share it with you.

00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,840
So, let's do that.

00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:05,910
May I be a source of hope to help you see beyond the stars.

00:01:06,910 --> 00:01:12,910
May I inspire you to write, to look inside your soul so far.

00:01:14,910 --> 00:01:19,910
That you discover needs that only God above can fill.

00:01:20,910 --> 00:01:25,910
May my life reveal to you someone surrendered to his will.

00:01:25,910 --> 00:01:32,320
When you need a touch, let me be there to hold your hand.

00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:36,320
And when you lack of strength,

00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:39,320
beside you, I will stand.

00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,320
When happy, we'll share joy.

00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:46,320
Overwhelmed, I'll comfort you.

00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:49,320
But it feels that you're abandoned.

00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:52,320
You'll know that I am true.

00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:57,320
While your entire world is crumbling,

00:01:57,320 --> 00:02:01,320
and heavy is the day, I'll be beside you.

00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:05,320
Let our deeds lead us both to pray.

00:02:07,730 --> 00:02:12,730
We'll walk the difficult, traverse what seems immense,

00:02:13,730 --> 00:02:18,730
come through it all with scars, but wiser now, and cleansed.

00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:27,260
Then we'll gaze upon Almighty with eyes that see now clear.

00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:33,260
We'll stand upon the streets of gold, and shed a little tear.

00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:36,260
But not in sorrow anymore.

00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:45,260
Enjoy that rumbles deep from spots inside of us that once were fast asleep.

00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:50,260
We'll eat from trees that healed the woods of yesterday.

00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:55,260
Our bodies now renewed as children we will play.

00:02:56,260 --> 00:03:02,260
We'll dance the clouds with angels, we'll sing songs we've never heard.

00:03:03,260 --> 00:03:09,260
We'll know love that's indescribable by any human words.

00:03:10,260 --> 00:03:16,260
We'll know and see and hear the things impossible to write.

00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:23,260
A human heart could not contain the width, the depth, the height.

00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:31,860
So now, before we get there, let's just contemplate the view.

00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:37,860
But this I pray that I may be the hand of God to you.

